  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri), specifically the Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim), has initiated a formal case review concerning allegations of treason connected to the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As part of the ongoing investigation, police have designated four generals as suspects and have conducted search operations at multiple locations, including a residential site in Cipete identified as a command post for the group. The investigation, which began earlier in November, seeks to uncover the extent of the alleged plot and the involvement of high-ranking individuals. Officials and legal observers have emphasized the necessity of a transparent and thorough inquiry into these claims, noting that the relationship between the unauthorized surveillance of the head of state and the treason accusations remains a primary focus for the investigative team.",
